        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Waruna Josefu kuwuya Misri na Benjamini",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao njala ikachurikia kukaia mbaa isangenyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata iji wameria kuja vindo vose wereviredieghe kufuma Misri, ndee Jakobo ukawizera, “Wuyenyi sena mudighuye viro vimu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Juda ukaghamba, “Uja mundu oredilaghirieghe na ndighi ukighamba kukaia ndedichaawona wushu ghwake disechanye na mwanidu mtini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwu iji kwarumiria diseanye na mwanidu mtini, dichaghenda dimghuye viro; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela iji kwalegha, na isi wori ndedichaaghenda, kwa kukaia uja mundu wadizerie ndedichaawona wushu ghwake disechanye na mwanidu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jakobo ukaghamba, “Kwaki mwaniredia wasi huwu? Uja mundu moremghoriagha waki wei moko na mwanyinyu umu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawo wikamtumbulia, “Uja mundu oredikotereghe kwa wuya malagho ghedu na gha kichuku chedu ukighamba, ‘Ndeyo waduagha moyo? Moko na mwanyinyu umu?’ Nesi dikamtumbulia kunughana na makoto ghake. Disemanyagha kwa chia ingi wei udizera dimghenje mwanidu kwake.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Juda ukamzera ndee, “Msighe mwana nighendanye nao, nesi dichawuka dighende, eri disechebwaghwa ni njala isi, na oho, na wana wedu wori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ini nichakaia mdhamini kwa wundu ghwake, maza rake rose kuchanikotia ini. Iji yakaia simmbunjire kwako, lawama rose richakaia aighu kwapo kwa kala na kala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa kukaia ngera diseremukieghe luma, kumangu damerie kuwuya indo ja kawi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko ndee ukawizera, “Ikakaia ni suti maza rikaie huwo, bonyenyi huwu: Mudo matunda ghamu ghiboie gha isanga iji magunienyi konyu, ghikaie manosi kwa uja mundu. Mdwaienyi matunda gha zabibu riomie, wuki mtinieri, marumba, manemane, na njugu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sena mudo pesa mando awi ya rija ra imbiri, angu yamfwane kudwa rija pesa rerewunjiroghe memunyi ya magunia ghenyu kewada redeliwika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mwanyinyu Benjamini wori ghendanyenyi nao kwa uo mundu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlungu Uwadie-Ndighi-Rose, ndem'bonye uo mundu umfuye wughoma, ummbunjire Benjamini na uo mwanyinyu umu. Nani kamanya yaachakaia ni suti nisowekelo ni wana wapo, haya nisowekelo wokoni.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko aho awo wandu wikabonya wokoni, wikadwa agho manosi na pesa mando awi, na Benjamini; wikazoya charo cheghenda Misri, nawo wikavika na kukaia imbiri ya Josefu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji Josefu wammbona Benjamini andwamweri nawo, ukamzera mdumiki wake wa nyumbenyi, “Wighenje wandu awa nyumbenyi kwapo, kubwaghe nyamandu kuboise vindo, angu nichajanya nawo vindo va dime ghadi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uo mundu ukabonya wokoni sa iji orezereloghe ni Josefu, ukawighenja awo wandu nyumbenyi kwa Josefu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao wikaobua na ndighi angu wereghenjeroghe nyumbenyi kwa Josefu wikaghamba, “Ni kwa wundu ghwa rija pesa rerewunjiroghe magunienyi kodu charo cha imbiri, niko daredwa aha upate kulola shekeria yaro, nao udiwade na kudibonya wazumba wake, na weke punda wedu uwiwuse.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikamghendia mdumiki wa nyumbenyi wa Josefu, wikadedanya nao mnyangonyi ghwa nyumba wikighamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bwana, iji derechieghe kughua viro indo ja imbiri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngelo ya kuwuya, diendavika andu kohoreshera, derefungueghe magunia ghedu, dikakua pesa redu rose memunyi kwa magunia ghedu sa iji koni rerekoghe. Kwa huwu darireda sena; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na pesa zima dadwae reghua viro vizima. Ndedimanyire ngera nani uringirie iro pesa magunienyi kodu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ukawitumbulia, “Kaienyi na sere, msakeobua: yadimika Mlungu onyu, uo Mlungu wa ndeyo, nuo ungirie iro mali magunienyi konyu; nerepatireghe pesa renyu to.” Nao ukawifunyira Simeoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji uja mundu wameria kuwireda nyumbenyi kwa Josefu, na kuwineka machi gheoghosha maghu ghawo, na vindo kwa wundu ghwa weke punda wawo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wikazoya kuboisa manosi ghawo, ghemneka Josefu iji wacha mzinyi kwa vindo va dime ghadi, angu wereghoreloghe wichaja vindo kwake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji Josefu wacha mzinyi, wikamsoghoria agho manosi weremdwaeghe, wikamghoghomia hata andonyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ukawikotia malagho gha mzinyi kwawo ukighamba, “Ndeyo uja mghosi moreghoragha oko mana? Waduagha moyo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao wikaghamba, “Mdumiki wako aba oko mana, waduagha moyo.” Wikaghoghomesha vongo vawo kwa ishima ibaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Josefu uendawusira meso ghake, na kummbona mruna Benjamini, uo mruna wa mae, ukawikotia, “Uhu nuo uja mwanyinyu mtini morenizeragha? Mlungu ndekuneke mvono mwanwapo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Josefu ukabonya shwa-shwa kuinjika, angu ngolo yake erekoghe yanyavurika kwa lukundo kwa wundu ghwa mruna, ukalola andu kumu kolilia; ukangia chumbenyi kwake ukalila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ukaoghosha wushu ghwake, ukafuma ukikumazira uo moni ukaghamba, “Redenyi vindo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao wikam'boisira vindo vake uekeri, na vindo va waruna wiekeri, na Wamisri awa werechieghe kujanya nao wikaboisirwa andu kwawo kula na Waebrania, angu yadarighidwa Mmisri kujanya na Muebrania. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikakupanga weni kwa kuvalwa kwawo, kufuma wa imbiri hata wa kutua; wikasea kidombo wikizighanana kwa kushinika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vindo verekoghe vikibeghwa na kuwaghilwa kula mundu iwaghio jake kufuma mezenyi kwa Josefu, ela Benjamini ukabeghelwa vipimo visanu kuchumba kula umu wawo. Nawo wikaja, wikanywa, na kuboilwa chiaimweri nao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
